                        "sense_id": "7971d32a-c7e5-362f-94fe-d720fcdbcffb",
                        "entry_id": "4e8657ba-faf1-3f06-808b-3076d51b4afb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A band for the hair."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f15bc8c-c11c-44fe-8764-d42052f92f89",
                                "sense_id": "7971d32a-c7e5-362f-94fe-d720fcdbcffb",
                                "text": "She wore a bandeau in her hair."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5d441d3-c0eb-49c2-82c2-10e271f9c937",
                                "sense_id": "7971d32a-c7e5-362f-94fe-d720fcdbcffb",
                                "text": "You dress with a square glass before you, and a long glass behind you; your hair trusts to its own brown or black attractions, either curled or braided,—or you put on a wreath, a bunch of flowers, or a pearl bandeau;..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2fb4aab-eb19-4586-bbbf-d0871b527e86",
                                "sense_id": "7971d32a-c7e5-362f-94fe-d720fcdbcffb",
                                "text": "an elaborate tombstone over a prebendary's widow, a dead lady with a Grecian nose, a bandeau, and an intricate lace veil; lying of course on a marble sofa"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b48215f5-19af-4ec6-be74-47f4d33f0ee2",
                                "sense_id": "7971d32a-c7e5-362f-94fe-d720fcdbcffb",
                                "text": "Fragment of a wool cap, of which only the bandeau is well preserved. It is made in square knotting in alternate directions (see Fig. 79)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2ab330c6-7b81-3ee4-9612-1cf3007c32ae",
                        "entry_id": "4e8657ba-faf1-3f06-808b-3076d51b4afb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A band."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fff604b1-b3bc-4f95-b6ff-d9447c9f7a1b",
                                "sense_id": "2ab330c6-7b81-3ee4-9612-1cf3007c32ae",
                                "text": "1998, AANS Publications Committee: Setti S. Rengachary, MD, and Edward C. Benzel, MD, Calvarial and Dural Reconstruction: Neurosurgical Topics\nThe frontal bandeau is then elevated en bloc. A Bi on BC1 (Midas Rex) bit is used to create the osteotomies circumferentially."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f225a8fc-861e-4421-bbb7-cd56a81f51a1",
                                "sense_id": "2ab330c6-7b81-3ee4-9612-1cf3007c32ae",
                                "text": "The supraorbital bandeau is fixed to the nasal structure by a titanium [...]\nThis bandeau is fixed by microplates. The median bone strip is fixed to the [...]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "faa8c54d-f111-3c56-91c5-640be3e13251",
                        "entry_id": "4e8657ba-faf1-3f06-808b-3076d51b4afb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A narrow, tight bra, especially when strapless; hence, any women's top made from a similar band of fabric."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "91944aac-c608-40ba-bda2-9709b5c4dabd",
                                "sense_id": "faa8c54d-f111-3c56-91c5-640be3e13251",
                                "text": "At Paris fashion week, a few weeks later, Kim’s sister Kendall wore a minimalist black bandeau top that echoed Kim’s look."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
